{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-04_end","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-04","title":"龜裂","storyCode":"3-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-04_end.txt","sourceHash":"4a002bf3682adbec86fd1972e1bf723afe1c96bc8f1c4dc90e69bdbbca58de8a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"被看破的埋伏只是障眼法，一切都是在為那瞄準博士的一擊做準備。\n即使第一擊被擋住，處心積慮的第二擊也終於向著博士激射而去——","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我們明明只消滅了一個整合運動小隊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"還順勢按倒了一個大塊頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"這個才是重頭戲好嗎，為了對付他，我可是累壞了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼多感染者，怎麼可能消失的無影無蹤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那個大傢伙，只是打個掩護而已？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動在這麼短的時間裡撤出了這個區域？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不，陳長官理應截斷了他們的後路——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"我看不到訊息點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡......不對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"雜草，廢墟，沙丘......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"全是值得埋伏的地點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"但我，什麼都看不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"腳印，服飾刮擦植物的聲音，爆炸物特有的氣息......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒法判斷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"企鵝快遞的傢伙，打起精神來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"一切都不對勁！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收聲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼聲音......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"————嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"是從......地下！？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！從地下傳來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"！！！！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！！快趴下！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這群人......真是不擇手段！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"————！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼......你居然......能擋住？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這面“般若”，可不是你能打得穿的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500